Z||000011||deceler8||12-17-2000||12:17 PM||||I did take some photos, but they turned out poorly. Out of focus, for one thing.<P>Maybe I'll get a digital camera for Xmas...<P>They do look great and it wasn't difficult to do. The secret is not using too heavy of a grit sandpaper (the coating comes off pretty easily) and the polishing. I just used swirl/scratch remover with the Dremel.||||reg||1
Z||000012||William||12-17-2000||01:43 PM||||Thx to all for your comments!||||reg||1
